## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
1.  **Navigate**: Go to `/dashboard/emissions`.
2.  **View**: Check if list is empty or shows existing data (if any).
3.  **Add Fuel**: Click "Add Data", select "Fuel Consumption", fill form (select facility, fuel type, quantity), submit. Verify list update.
4.  **Add Clinker**: Click "Add Data", select "Clinker Production", fill form (production volume), submit. Verify list update.
5.  **Delete**: Test deletion of an entry.
